WEBVTT

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.260
Jack Atlas won't lose to 
the power of the shadows!

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:17.230
It's over!

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:21.930
With two consecutive victories, 
Team 5D's advances to the finals!

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.750
Why did you save me?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.640
Why?  Isn't it obvious?

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.400
It's because you aren't worthy of dying!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.110
A duel is a clash between souls.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:38.120
You don't believe in your own cards 
and resort to using shadow cards.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.450
You have no right to duel!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.590
I finally found the information.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.460
Shadow cards link to Iliaster.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.680
Go, Diablos.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.070
Plummet this city into chaos.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.920
Where did you get that card?

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.520
What's this?

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.140
Hey!  The light is red!

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.180
What's that?

00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:01.230
Do your best, Team Lightning!

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.430
Don't lose, Team White Tiger!

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.860
What are those black D-Wheels?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.290
Are they doing a demo?

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.580
No way.  We're in the middle of a duel.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.520
What?

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.780
What are you doing?

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.750
We'll also take part in this duel.

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:29.580
Battle Royal Mode on.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.430
Switching to Battle Royal Mode.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:37.260
Battle Royal Mode?  I've never heard of that!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.730
Duel!

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.710
My turn.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.670
I summon Ally of Justice Nullfier.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:49.750
Then I set two cards and end my turn.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:52.410
My turn.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.880
I summon Ally of Justice Garadholg.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.350
I activate a trap.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.110
Release & Reverse.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:06.830
By releasing a card on my field, I take 
damage equal to its attack points.

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:11.110
The released card resurrects 
on the opponent's field.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.000
He gave him his monster!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.970
I attack you directly with two monsters.

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:19.100
I won't let you do that!

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.500
I activate the trap Negate Attack!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.940
It negates your monsters' attacks 
and ends the Battle Phase!

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:28.410
That's useless.  The Counter 
Trap Solemn Judgment!

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:29.250
What?

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:33.850
By halving my life points, I negate 
the activation of Negate Attack.

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:37.960
Go, Garadholg and Nullfier!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.370
My turn.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:06.380
The WRGP preliminaries have now 
switched to Battle Royal Mode.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.180
Our duels are life-or-death.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:14.090
D-Wheelers, draw the Circuit 
if you want to live.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.490
Riding Duels.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.630
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:28.310
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:49.840
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:59.630
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:05.950
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:12.040
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:17.820
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:23.660
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:29.820
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:35.630
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:41.800
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:48.220
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:17.540
Ghost Flood!Terrifying Battle Royal Mode

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.280
I've received breaking news.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:24.410
There are accidents on the highways 
where we're holding the preliminaries!

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.450
Look!

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:33.670
Everyone in the stadium, please remain in 
your seats and wait for further orders.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:35.930
What's going on?

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.130
We have to stay here?

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.330
What's happening?

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:45.800
What's going on?  There 
are so many accidents!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.900
Control room!  What's happening?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.110
Control room!

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.580
We don't know the cause.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:56.910
The highways' Riding Duel system 
suddenly changed to Battle Royal Mode.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:58.200
What?

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.380
Please wait.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.740
We've confirmed new ID signals.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.860
There's so many!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:07.530
Give us a visual of the ID signals' location.

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.680
That's Ghost!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.900
Ghost?

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.010
Sherry, Mizoguchi.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:25.610
Sherry...  She's lovely.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.390
Sherry, Ghost appeared.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:32.050
Yes.  They also showed it at the stadium.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:35.130
I thought that we were their target.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:37.160
It seems things have changed.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:41.660
Since there are so many Ghosts, they're 
trying to destroy this tournament.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.630
I agree.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:48.600
Then let's face their shadow duels!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:52.530
But how?  There's so many of them.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.390
Someone must be controlling them.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:57.260
Let's split up and find him.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.130
We'll also help.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.540
I'm going too.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.680
Kazama!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.650
Don't get in the way this time, Jack.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.120
That's what I'm supposed to say.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:14.400
Be careful.  The highway system 
has changed to Battle Royal Mode.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:18.730
You're crazy!  The side with 
more members will win this duel!

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:23.400
Damage becomes real in 
Riding Duels against Ghost.

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:26.140
If we duel badly, we'll be seriously hurt.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.300
That's what makes it fun.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:32.310
My past blood boils since 
I don't have to hold back.

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:34.840
Let's go, everyone!

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:40.550
We brought peace to Neo Domino City!  
We won't let them take it away!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.920
Wait up!

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:59.900
The Circuit is steadily forming.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:07.130
But it's so troublesome to need 
D-Wheelers to create the Circuit.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:11.020
We need the Moment's power 
to complete the Circuit.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:14.190
Therefore, we need the power of the D-Wheels.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:19.740
Luckily, people of this world don't 
know the Moment's true power.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:24.360
When the Circuit is complete, 
god's temple will appear.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:29.280
This Circuit is humongous.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.900
It's the same size as Neo Domino City.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.970
If a castle this large appears, 
the city will be destroyed.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:39.450
That's a small sacrifice to save the future.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:41.170
What's going on?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.300
What's this?

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:46.700
That's Diablo, and there are so many of them!

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:50.150
Diablo...  That's Placido's 
refurbished Riding Roid.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.760
Placido became tired of waiting 
and sent his large army.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.260
This is worth watching.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:01.230
How dare Placido take 
matters into his own hands!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.800
Who are you?

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.870
Die!  Nullfier, attack her directly!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.340
I'll stop that attack with this card.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.280
Swift Scarecrow!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.090
What?

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.710
It's you!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.400
Leave this duel to me!

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.630
My turn!

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.760
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:44.740
Then I Special Summon Swift Scarecrow from 
my graveyard and Mirror Ladybug from my hand!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:52.280
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes Level 1 Swift 
Scarecrow and Level 4 Mirror Ladybug!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.780
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:58.330
Become the path that lights the way!

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.350
Synchro Summon!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.950
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:07.520
Go, Stardust Dragon!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.020
Shooting Sonic!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:24.110
Die!  Go, Clausolas!

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:27.910
I won't let you do that!

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:30.780
Battle Eater's effect!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:33.180
I'll take that damage instead!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.820
If you push too hard, you'll get hurt again!

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:43.490
I'm just not graceful.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:48.330
I'll lose face if you get hurt again.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.540
Let me handle this!

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.580
My turn!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.170
I summon Vice Berserker!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:01.840
I can Special Summon this card by 
paying your trap card as a cost!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:04.010
Appear, Trap Eater!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:09.860
Level 4 Trap Eater tunes 
Level 4 Vice Berserker!

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:13.280
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.720
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.720
Synchro Summon!

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:21.490
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.560
I activate Vice Berserker's effect!

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:32.740
Retribution!  Red Dragon Archfiend will pay 
you back in double for the fallen D-Wheelers!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:35.710
Absolute Powerforce!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.990
I can't stay here and do nothing!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.210
No, Crow!  You have to rest!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.140
This isn't the time for that!

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:55.550
In your condition, you're 
only going to get in the way.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:58.170
A teammate's duty is to trust them!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.830
Luca, you're so reliable!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.780
It's because you're not reliable, Lua!

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.000
I'm counting on you, Yusei.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.420
This is all due to Yusei Fudo.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.760
What do you want?  I'm busy!

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.360
Placido, how dare you act on your own!

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.960
Your way is lame.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:31.830
If you force them to duel, they'll 
create the Circuit quickly.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.680
Placido, you don't understand.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:39.440
If you force them to battle, you 
can't draw out their true potential.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.410
So you can't create a perfect Circuit.

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:46.030
Besides, Yusei Fudo is trying to stop you.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:49.960
You already lost to him once, 
so you should listen to Jose.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.080
What?

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:55.260
Sorry, but I'll do things my way.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.050
Placido!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.800
Yusei Fudo, don't get cocky.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:03.890
I'll show you that humans can't defeat me.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.500
My turn-

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.800
What?  They're pulling back.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:13.540
What?

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.200
They've stopped dueling?

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.740
No.  The Ghosts' signals are...

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:19.710
This is...

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.010
They're gathering at one location.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.320
Is it over?

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.020
Yusei!

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.590
What?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:56.110
Yusei, all the attacks are focused on you!

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.640
There's so many of them!

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.940
Switching to Battle Royal Mode.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:26.000
They forced us into Duel Mode.  Be careful.

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:30.280
Let's duel, Yusei Fudo!  My turn!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.650
I summon Ally of Justice Garadholg.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:36.380
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.090
Let me handle this.  My turn!

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.200
I summon Spirit Summit Warrior.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:45.210
When I summon this card,

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.990
I can Special Summon a Level 3-or-below 
Warrior-Type monster from my hand.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.340
I summon Liberated Rear Warrior.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:58.140
Level 3 Liberated Rear Warrior tunes 
Level 4 Spirit Summit Warrior.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.140
Synchro Summon!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:02.170
Driven Daredevil!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:07.510
Go, Driven Daredevil!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.920
Thanks for your sacrifice!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.810
I'm next.  I draw!

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.160
I activate Speed Spell - Overboost!

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:29.870
I'll only have 1 Speed Counter at the End 
Phase, but I gain 4 Speed Counters for now.

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:34.810
I activate Speed Spell - Speed Fusion!

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:38.940
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters...

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:42.430
...I can Special Summon a Fusion 
Monster by sending specific monsters

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.750
in my hand or field to the graveyard.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:49.290
I fuse Sacred Knight's Spearholder and 
Horse of the Floral Knights in my hand!

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:52.570
Appear, Centaur Mina!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.460
Then I summon Fleur Synchron!

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:02.230
Level 2 Fleur Synchron 
tunes Level 6 Centaur Mina!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.970
The body born from the speed of light!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.880
It's time for the revolution!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.410
Bring me victory!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.210
Synchro Summon!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.370
Sparkle, Chevalier de Fleur!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.010
Chevalier de Fleur attacks you directly!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.420
Fleur du Orage!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:28.970
My turn!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:33.060
I send Quillbolt Hedgehog 
in my hand to the graveyard

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.160
to Special Summon Quickdraw Synchron!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:42.000
When a Tuner is on my field, I can resurrect 
Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.710
Resurrect, Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.920
Then I Special Summon Reed Butterfly!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:52.510
I can Special Summon it when you're 
the only one with a Synchro Monster!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:59.590
Level 5 Quickdraw Synchron tunes Level 1 
Reed Butterfly and Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:03.580
Hope comes together to invite a new land!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.230
Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:07.760
Synchro Summon!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.600
Drive through, Road Warrior!

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:15.200
Due to Road Warrior's effect, 
I Special Summon Speed Warrior!

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.420
Go, Speed Warrior!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.340
Sonic Edge!

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:34.150
Go, Road Warrior!  Lightning Claw!

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.900
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.370
My turn.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.340
I activate the trap Synchro Prominence!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:54.600
The player who controls a Synchro Monster 
deals 1000 points of damage to the opponent!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.210
Go!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:55.940
Take this!

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:16.230
You're in my way.  The weaklings must perish.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:20.400
I summon Ally of Justice Tractor.

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:23.080
When a Light Attribute 
monster is on your field...

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:29.170
I can release this card to add two Ally 
of Justice cards from my deck to my hand.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:33.320
Yusei, your Road Warrior is 
a Light Attribute monster.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:36.490
Therefore, I Special Summon three monsters!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.680
Three?

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:44.920
When you have two or more monsters, 
including a Light Attribute monster...

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:47.240
I can Special Summon Cosmic 
Gateway from my hand.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:50.630
Cosmic Gateway, attack Driven Daredevil!

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:59.500
It's mutual destruction.  
Driven Daredevil is destroyed.

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:02.660
The other two Cosmic Gateways attack!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:07.880
Mizoguchi!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.020
Sherry!

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:16.270
I set one card and end my turn.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.640
My turn.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.460
I activate the Continuous 
Trap DNA Transplant.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:25.980
All cards on the field become 
the Attribute of my choice.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:28.230
I choose Light Attribute!

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.790
I summon Ally Salvo.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.700
Go, Ally Salvo!

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:40.530
Ally Salvo's effect activates.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:43.770
When it's destroyed in battle 
against a Light Attribute monster,

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.820
two cards on the field are destroyed.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:46.780
Oh no!

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:51.880
Due to DNA Transplant, Chevalier de 
Fleur was changed to Light Attribute!

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:55.660
What?

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:59.280
My turn!  I summon Ally Salvo!

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:00.830
It attacks you directly!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.930
My turn!

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:18.080
Sherry!

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.650
Ally Salvo's effect will 
